 * those leaves: the un-overridden base cart page never passes the raw `basket.productItems[i]`
 * alone — it merges it with the matching full `Product` (fetched separately via `useProducts`)
 * before handing it down: `product={{...productItem, ...productsByItemId[productItem.itemId],
 * price: productItem.price, quantity: ...}}` (see
